<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">凌晨五点 我脱口而出 要是永远都是深夜就好了</text><text for="L2">眼里剩下的 只有波形和烂透的贝斯样轨</text><text for="L3">偶然⇄必然之间的造作 晨雾漫过四季</text><text for="L4">想先写下一首用来止痛的歌</text><text for="L5">再也逃不出这日复一日</text><text for="L6">想放弃却放不下 痛苦得要命</text><text for="L7">还去揣摩别人的脸色 傻不傻啊</text><text for="L8">我做出来的 不都是早已有过的东西嘛</text><text for="L9">熬到深夜 总觉得还能做成些什么</text><text for="L10">也想给它一个归宿</text><text for="L11">别期待我会成为多特别的人</text><text for="L12">连T恤都皱得一塌糊涂</text><text for="L13">小心别败给那一缕残香的偷袭⚠</text><text for="L14">我只想讨一点意义 花一匁</text><text for="L15">哪怕明知终究得不到</text><text for="L16">却净絮絮说些不像我的话</text><text for="L17">要是你还能对这样的我笑一笑就好了</text><text for="L18">脱口而出的软弱话语 四散飞去了</text><text for="L19">染脏你白色衣袖的人 明明是我</text><text for="L20">你为什么反而道歉了</text><text for="L21">从那以后 我就再也没能站上舞台</text><text for="L22">再也逃不出这日复一日</text><text for="L23">想放弃却放不下 还挂着讨好的笑脸</text><text for="L24">还去揣摩别人的脸色 傻不傻啊</text><text for="L25">我唱出来的 不也都是早已有过的东西嘛</text><text for="L26">熬到深夜 总觉得还能做成些什么</text><text for="L27">终于有了归宿的诗</text><text for="L28">别期待我会成为多特别的人</text><text for="L29">连T恤都皱得一塌糊涂</text><text for="L30">小心别败给那一缕残香的偷袭⚠</text><text for="L31">我只想讨一点意义 花一匁</text><text for="L32">哪怕明知终究得不到</text><text for="L33">却净絮絮说些不像我的话</text><text for="L34">要是你还能对这样的我笑一笑就好了</text><text for="L35">穿着睡衣 开起一场共鸣会议</text><text for="L36">披头散发 半干的发梢甩起水花</text><text for="L37">明早还得早起 正逢塑料垃圾日</text><text for="L38">设好吵人的闹钟 晚安…☽</text><text for="L39">就算被人笑话 我还是会失落</text><text for="L40">可我还是学不会讨好</text><text for="L41">也不奢望什么特别的未来 死</text><text for="L42">连T恤都皱得一塌糊涂</text><text for="L43">把那一缕残香刻进心底 别让它流逝⚠</text><text for="L44">败了也欢喜 花一匁</text><text for="L45">想要一张治得住寂寞的处方</text><text for="L46">却净絮絮说些不像我的话</text><text for="L47">明早还得早起 今夜就别太勉强自己</text><text for="L48">愿你一直平安健康</text><text for="L49">花一匁</text><text for="L50">花一匁</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="花一匁"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="沈香学"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1688968528"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:19.526" end="0:51.758" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0:19.526" end="0:22.770" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.526" end="0:19.976">ずっと</span><span begin="0:19.976" end="0:20.540">真夜中で</span><span begin="0:20.540" end="0:21.203">いいのに</span><span begin="0:21.203" end="0:21.423">って</span><span begin="0:21.423" end="0:21.762">溢</span><span begin="0:21.762" end="0:21.959">した</span><span begin="0:21.959" end="0:22.365">午前5</span><span begin="0:22.365" end="0:22.770">時</span></p><p begin="0:22.800" end="0:26.617" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.800" end="0:23.664">目に見えてん</span><span begin="0:23.664" end="0:23.781">の</span><span begin="0:23.781" end="0:24.109">は</span> <span begin="0:24.109" end="0:24.482">波形</span><span begin="0:24.482" end="0:24.719">だ</span><span begin="0:24.719" end="0:24.819">け</span><span begin="0:24.819" end="0:25.082">です</span> <span begin="0:25.082" end="0:25.182">腐</span><span begin="0:25.182" end="0:25.658">れ</span><span begin="0:25.658" end="0:25.758">た</span><span begin="0:25.758" end="0:26.027">デ</span><span begin="0:26.027" end="0:26.151">モ</span><span begin="0:26.151" end="0:26.469">ベー</span><span begin="0:26.469" end="0:26.617">ス</span></p><p begin="0:26.617" end="0:30.835" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.617" end="0:27.130">偶</span><span begin="0:27.130" end="0:27.655">然⇄</span><span begin="0:27.655" end="0:27.984">必</span><span begin="0:27.984" end="0:28.239">然</span><span begin="0:28.239" end="0:28.621">の</span><span begin="0:28.621" end="0:29.001">工作</span> <span begin="0:29.001" end="0:29.364">朝</span><span begin="0:29.364" end="0:29.863">靄</span><span begin="0:29.863" end="0:30.108">は</span><span begin="0:30.108" end="0:30.378">4</span><span begin="0:30.378" end="0:30.618">シー</span><span begin="0:30.618" end="0:30.835">ズン</span></p><p begin="0:30.835" end="0:34.519" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.835" end="0:31.302">痛</span><span begin="0:31.302" end="0:31.631">み</span><span begin="0:31.631" end="0:31.911">止</span><span begin="0:31.911" end="0:32.076">め</span><span begin="0:32.076" end="0:32.384">用の</span><span begin="0:32.384" end="0:32.740">曲</span> <span begin="0:32.740" end="0:33.289">作っ</span><span begin="0:33.289" end="0:33.585">と</span><span begin="0:33.585" end="0:33.789">き</span><span begin="0:33.789" end="0:34.338">た</span><span begin="0:34.338" end="0:34.519">い</span></p><p begin="0:34.631" end="0:37.932" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.631" end="0:35.156">ルー</span><span begin="0:35.156" end="0:35.638">ティン</span><span begin="0:35.638" end="0:36.134">から</span> <span begin="0:36.134" end="0:36.552">もう</span><span begin="0:36.552" end="0:37.510">抜け出せ</span><span begin="0:37.510" end="0:37.932">ない</span></p><p begin="0:37.932" end="0:41.892" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.932" end="0:38.498">辞め</span><span begin="0:38.498" end="0:38.974">たい</span><span begin="0:38.974" end="0:39.912">辞められ</span><span begin="0:39.912" end="0:40.343">ない</span> <span begin="0:40.343" end="0:41.062">苦しい</span><span begin="0:41.062" end="0:41.255">ほ</span><span begin="0:41.255" end="0:41.892">ど</span></p><p begin="0:42.198" end="0:45.521" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.198" end="0:42.661">ご</span><span begin="0:42.661" end="0:43.129">機嫌</span><span begin="0:43.129" end="0:43.633">なんて</span><span begin="0:43.633" end="0:44.109">伺っ</span><span begin="0:44.109" end="0:44.372">て</span> <span begin="0:44.372" end="0:44.877">ばか</span><span begin="0:44.877" end="0:45.098">じゃ</span><span begin="0:45.098" end="0:45.521">ない？</span></p><p begin="0:45.521" end="0:51.758" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.521" end="0:46.088">僕</span><span begin="0:46.088" end="0:46.553">が</span><span begin="0:46.553" end="0:47.464">作るも</span><span begin="0:47.464" end="0:47.919">の</span><span begin="0:47.919" end="0:48.161">は</span> <span begin="0:48.161" end="0:49.556">既にあるも</span><span begin="0:49.556" end="0:49.993">の</span><span begin="0:50.159" end="0:51.191">じゃーー</span><span begin="0:51.191" end="0:51.758">ん</span></p></div><div begin="0:52.564" end="1:24.326" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0:52.564" end="0:55.612" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.564" end="0:53.615">何か出</span><span begin="0:53.615" end="0:54.030">来</span><span begin="0:54.030" end="0:54.516">そうな</span><span begin="0:54.516" end="0:55.612">夜更かし</span></p><p begin="0:55.612" end="0:57.341" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.612" end="0:56.435">成仏</span><span begin="0:56.435" end="0:57.146">させた</span><span begin="0:57.146" end="0:57.341">し</span></p><p begin="0:57.341" end="1:01.116" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:57.341" end="0:57.875">特</span><span begin="0:57.875" end="0:58.324">別</span><span begin="0:58.324" end="0:58.549">な</span><span begin="0:58.549" end="0:59.229">キャラに</span><span begin="0:59.229" end="0:59.700">期待</span><span begin="0:59.700" end="1:00.048">は</span><span begin="1:00.048" end="1:00.644">しない</span><span begin="1:00.644" end="1:01.116">で</span></p><p begin="1:01.119" end="1:03.093" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.119" end="1:01.601">T</span><span begin="1:01.601" end="1:01.889">シャツ</span><span begin="1:01.889" end="1:02.080">も</span> <span begin="1:02.080" end="1:02.517">しわ</span><span begin="1:02.517" end="1:02.687">く</span><span begin="1:02.687" end="1:03.093">ちゃ</span></p><p begin="1:03.215" end="1:07.958" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.215" end="1:03.702">淡い</span><span begin="1:03.702" end="1:04.401">残り</span><span begin="1:04.401" end="1:04.929">香の</span><span begin="1:04.929" end="1:05.431">攻</span><span begin="1:05.431" end="1:05.904">撃</span><span begin="1:05.904" end="1:06.179">に</span> <span begin="1:06.179" end="1:06.772">やられ</span><span begin="1:06.772" end="1:07.217">ない</span><span begin="1:07.217" end="1:07.563">よう</span><span begin="1:07.563" end="1:07.958">に⚠</span></p><p begin="1:07.958" end="1:11.631" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.958" end="1:08.745">意味が</span><span begin="1:08.745" end="1:09.456">欲しい</span><span begin="1:09.456" end="1:09.923">よ</span> <span begin="1:09.937" end="1:10.877">花一</span><span begin="1:10.877" end="1:11.631">匁</span></p><p begin="1:11.669" end="1:15.448" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.669" end="1:12.271">手に</span><span begin="1:12.271" end="1:13.346">入らない</span><span begin="1:13.346" end="1:13.931">こと</span> <span begin="1:13.931" end="1:14.684">わかっ</span><span begin="1:14.684" end="1:15.116">てて</span><span begin="1:15.116" end="1:15.448">も</span></p><p begin="1:15.466" end="1:20.060" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.466" end="1:16.267">柄に</span><span begin="1:16.267" end="1:17.038">ないこ</span><span begin="1:17.038" end="1:17.431">と</span><span begin="1:17.446" end="1:18.148">ばかり</span> <span begin="1:18.148" end="1:18.412">た</span><span begin="1:18.412" end="1:18.639">らた</span><span begin="1:18.639" end="1:18.903">ら</span><span begin="1:18.903" end="1:19.499">溢</span><span begin="1:19.499" end="1:19.642">し</span><span begin="1:19.642" end="1:20.060">て</span></p><p begin="1:20.240" end="1:24.326" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.240" end="1:20.538">こん</span><span begin="1:20.538" end="1:20.843">な</span><span begin="1:20.843" end="1:21.317">僕</span><span begin="1:21.317" end="1:21.513">を</span><span begin="1:21.513" end="1:21.768">ま</span><span begin="1:21.768" end="1:22.195">た</span> <span begin="1:22.195" end="1:22.712">笑っ</span><span begin="1:22.712" end="1:22.956">てく</span><span begin="1:22.956" end="1:23.187">れ</span><span begin="1:23.187" end="1:23.748">たらいいの</span><span begin="1:23.748" end="1:24.326">に</span></p></div><div begin="1:31.290" end="2:03.865" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:31.290" end="1:34.612" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:31.290" end="1:31.815">飛ん</span><span begin="1:31.815" end="1:32.172">でっ</span><span begin="1:32.172" end="1:32.391">ちゃっ</span><span begin="1:32.391" end="1:32.743">た</span> <span begin="1:32.743" end="1:33.263">弱</span><span begin="1:33.263" end="1:33.502">音</span><span begin="1:33.502" end="1:33.674">が</span><span begin="1:33.674" end="1:33.923">飛</span><span begin="1:33.923" end="1:34.280">び散っ</span><span begin="1:34.280" end="1:34.612">た</span></p><p begin="1:34.702" end="1:38.885" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:34.702" end="1:35.194">君</span><span begin="1:35.194" end="1:35.418">の</span><span begin="1:35.418" end="1:35.803">白い</span><span begin="1:35.803" end="1:36.177">袖</span><span begin="1:36.177" end="1:36.599">を</span> <span begin="1:36.599" end="1:37.069">汚</span><span begin="1:37.069" end="1:38.001">したのは</span><span begin="1:38.001" end="1:38.661">僕だ</span><span begin="1:38.661" end="1:38.885">よ</span></p><p begin="1:38.885" end="1:40.223" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.885" end="1:39.357">なんで</span><span begin="1:39.357" end="1:39.867">謝っ</span><span begin="1:39.867" end="1:40.223">た？</span></p><p begin="1:40.335" end="1:46.222" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.335" end="1:40.845">あの</span><span begin="1:40.845" end="1:41.311">時</span><span begin="1:41.311" end="1:42.558">から舞台</span><span begin="1:42.558" end="1:42.910">に</span> <span begin="1:42.946" end="1:43.867">立てない</